<!--
  sphere.urdf.xacro: Sphere-Scout robot model.
  Owner: TODO(kickoff)

  TODO: include params.xacro; no literal dimensions in this file.

  TODO: link/joint tree
    base_link                     core; CoM offset below the axle by core_com_offset_z
    left_shell_joint  (prismatic, along the axle)  -> left_slider
    left_wheel_joint  (continuous)                  -> left_shell
    right_shell_joint (prismatic, axis REVERSED so a positive command opens both shells) -> right_slider
    right_wheel_joint (continuous)                  -> right_shell
    thermal_joint     (fixed) -> thermal_link       camera faces +X
    imu_joint         (fixed) -> imu_link
  TODO: each shell collision = one sphere of radius shell_radius, centered on the axle at the
        shell's rim plane. Visuals: simple primitives for now.
  TODO: inertias from standard solid-body formulas using the params; no zero or near-zero values.

  TODO: Gazebo Harmonic blocks (gz-sim-*-system filenames, gz::sim::systems::* names only)
    - DiffDrive: left/right wheel joints, wheel_separation = rolling_gap, wheel_radius = shell_radius,
      topic cmd_vel, odom_topic odom, frame_id odom, child_frame_id base_link
    - JointPositionController x2 (one per prismatic joint), both on topic shell_cmd
    - JointStatePublisher on topic joint_states
    - thermal sensor on thermal_link: type thermal, topic thermal/image_raw, update_rate 8,
      horizontal_fov 0.96, 32 x 24, format L16, clip 0.05 to 20,
      ThermalSensor system with resolution 0.01
    - IMU sensor on imu_link: topic imu/data, update_rate 100, always_on, gaussian noise on
      angular velocity and linear acceleration (stddevs: TODO(kickoff))
  No ros2_control.
-->
